  "description": "Tokyo JR schematic anchored by the complete 30-station Yamanote loop, extending southwest along Tokaido to Odawara via Hiratsuka. Shonan-Shinjuku includes Tokaido-bound rapid and Yokosuka-bound local services to Odawara and Zushi, cropped north at Akabane. Rapid is not special rapid: it serves all Tokaido stations south of Totsuka. Other adjacent corridors retain their named cropped boundaries; these are not necessarily real service termini. Keihin-Tohoku uses its local stopping pattern. No subway, northern regional branches, airport links or timetable simulation. Original north-up schematic, not copied map artwork.",
